  "turn": 1,
  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "I found TX-0401 and verified the amount:\n\n- **Transaction:** TX-0401\n- **Date:** 2026-07-20\n- **Merchant:** TechMart Online\n- **Amount:** EUR 240.00 (outgoing card payment)\n- **Status:** Settled\n\nYour account records also show another card payment to TechMart Online, TX-0402, for EUR 240.00 on 2026-07-14. I mention it only because it has the same merchant and amount. I haven't assumed anything about what happened.\n\nBased on the dispute reason codes Verta supports, these could apply depending on the circumstances:\n\n- **duplicate_charge:** You were charged more than once for the same purchase. This could fit if TX-0401 and TX-0402 are both for one order.\n- **fraud_card_not_present:** A card payment was made without your authorization, such as an online purchase you did not make.\n- **unauthorized_debit:** Money left your account without your permission.\n- **goods_not_received:** You paid for goods that were never delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered:** You paid for a service that was never provided.\n\nTell me what happened with TX-0401, and I'll check which of these codes is eligible before anything is filed. I won't open a dispute without your go-ahead.",
